k39-k52), omits the "in skilletor.json" / "Adds sources like marketplaces and puts the CLI
on PATH" detail plugin.json now carries, and keeps a "preferred successor to manage-skills"
line plugin.json does not have. This is the item the release checklist calls "the
marketplace entrys description matches plugin.json" - it currently does not.

~/dev/marketplace is out of scope for every skilletor agent to edit (house rule: never edit
